                        "review": "[h1]Fun 2D platformer that runs like butter on SteamDeck[/h1]\n\nI'm really enjoying playing Tembo the BadAss Elephant, and this is a really fun 2D platformer/side-scroller that has been ported from the PS4. Now normally most PS4 games won't run on the Steam, but the original wasn't very demanding of hardware and this port has been optimised right. If the words anthropromorphic 2D platformer lights up the monkey part of the brain, you're going to love it. He is one bad-ass elephant and its a cheap price that gives great value!",
